# ==============================================================================
# EasyEat Frontend - Environment Variables Template
# ==============================================================================
# In production on Render (Static Site), configure this in Environment Variables:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://<your-backend-service-name>.onrender.com/api/v1
#
# In local development, leave unset to use the default relative path '/api/v1'
# which is proxied by vite.config.ts to http://localhost:8080
# ==============================================================================

VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1
